    {
      "index": 0,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Hi! I'm on my way. Are you at the restaurant already?"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Yes, but there's a problem. Luna is closed tonight. There's a sign on the door that says 'private event'."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "What? But we booked a table for eight o'clock! Didn't they call you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "No, nobody called me. I think they made a mistake. Anyway, we need another place. Any ideas?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "There's a pizza place two streets away. We could just go there."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "That's easy, but it's Salma's birthday, and she loves fish. What about the fish restaurant by the river?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "That's twenty minutes by taxi. Will they have a table?"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "I'll call them now. If they have a table, we go there. If not, we can still go for pizza."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Good plan. I'll tell Salma and Karim there might be a change."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Great. So, the fish restaurant if they have a table, the pizza place if not. I'll message everyone in ten minutes."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Perfect. And let's not tell Salma what happened. The new place can be a surprise!"
    }
  ],
